==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Castle Guard (Rare Cat)|Castle Guard]], [[Castle Horseman (Rare Cat)|Castle Horseman]], [[Ashura (Rare Cat)|Ashura]], [[Battle Balloon (Rare Cat)|Battle Balloon]], [[Dragon Rider (Rare Cat)|Dragon Rider]], [[Pretty Cat (Rare Cat)|Pretty Cat]], [[Cyclops (Rare Cat)|Cyclops]], [[Golem (Special Cat)|Golem]], [[White Swordsman Cat (Special Cat)|White Swordsman Cat]] and [[Li'l Clops Cat Egg (Special Cat)|Li'l Clops Cat Egg]]

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Castle Guard (Enemy)|Castle Guards]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|Castle Horsemen]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Battle Balloon (Enemy)|Battle Balloon]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Dragon Rider (Enemy)|Dragon Rider]] spawns as the boss after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Castle & Dragon|Castle & Dragon Cats]] to win.

